{"id":"694825399","kind":"article","title":"参与式环境支持学习","author":"Andy Matuschak","original_authors":["Andy Matuschak"],"original_source_urls":["https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zU3Cw3dParuur9TFVNJMiqS"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"助记媒介 & 思想工具","date":"2024-04-27","updated":"2024-05-18","votes":7,"comment_count":6,"minutes":1,"chars":472,"keywords":["参与式环境","概念学习","学习投入","教学设计","实践学习"],"summary":"译文认为，理解概念需要投入努力；参与式环境会借活动自然促使学习者深入参与，而书籍等被动媒介通常难以激发同等程度的认知投入。作者以艺术夏令营为例，说明活动可以让学员在实践中反复运用颜色理论。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/694825399","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"参考文献"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"链接至本文（已汉化）"},{"id":"sec-3","level":2,"title":"声明"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"P8O8tNRH\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z8ccRLda8BqJafNxjQBpzis\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">理解概念需与其尽力较量</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>。为了支持这种努力，我们可以创建一个<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zRWEWHx4cQyqQWRh26gp7ad\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">参与式环境</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>，让活动自然地引发深入的参与。比如，一个艺术夏令营可能会包括很多绘画和绘图活动，这些活动能让学员在颜色理论上投入大量精力。</p><p data-pid=\"R0jMQGFC\">相比之下，像书籍这样的非参与式环境，通常是被动的。大多数读者不会投入太多努力，因此他们也难以深入理解内容。</p><hr/><h2 id=\"sec-1\">参考文献</h2><p data-pid=\"sTYeLglv\">Matuschak, A. (2019). Why books don’t work.<sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup> Retrieved from <a class=\"external\" href=\"https://andymatuschak.org/books\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"visible\">andymatuschak.org/books</span><span class=\"invisible\"></span></a></p><h2 id=\"sec-2\">链接至本文（已汉化）</h2><ul><li data-pid=\"i75LDsqF\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"698476935\" href=\"#/post/698476935\">§赋能环境、游戏和《启蒙琼林》</a></li><li data-pid=\"bCpu9yZQ\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"551039707\" href=\"#/post/551039707\">参与式环境</a></li><li data-pid=\"OpiWj1HV\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"555033920\" href=\"#/post/555033920\">游戏能有效地培养玩家的技能</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-3\">声明</h2><p data-pid=\"a1kSLiu9\">此内容发布由 Andy Matuschak 许可。未经允许，不得转载或修改。保留所有权利。</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"1bNtVikb\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>感谢主要译者 GPT-4，校对 Jarrett Ye<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zU3Cw3dParuur9TFVNJMiqS\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Participatory environments support learning (andymatuschak.org)</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 理解概念需与其尽力较量 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"442692019\" href=\"#/post/442692019\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 参与式环境 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"551039707\" href=\"#/post/551039707\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 为什么书本不起作用？ <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"390507468\" href=\"#/post/390507468\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"694626102","title":"设计新的赋能环境，可以看作是在打造一所超级大学（University++）","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":13,"minutes":2,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 助记媒介 & 思想工具"},{"id":"694984639","title":"《少龄淑女绘本启蒙琼林》","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":9,"minutes":2,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 助记媒介 & 思想工具"},{"id":"698476935","title":"§赋能环境、游戏和《启蒙琼林》","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":9,"minutes":6,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"390507468","title":"为什么书本不起作用？","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":170,"minutes":22,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"551039707","title":"参与式环境","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":10,"minutes":3,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"643871124","title":"Andy Matuschak - 自学，间隔重复，以及为什么书本不起作用","author":"Dwarkesh Patel","votes":289,"minutes":95,"reason":"跨作者共鸣「教学设计」· Dwarkesh Patel"}],"rec_answers":[]}